.gobbi/projects/gobbi/skills/orchestration/SKILL.md:162:### Step 3 — Preparation Loop
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/skills/orchestration/SKILL.md:170:**Loop iteration.** Rows 1-5 form one iteration. Row 5 decides whether to iterate (back to row 1) or exit the loop. Repeats up to `workflow.preparation.maxIterations` until `PASS`, `Skipped`, or cap exhausted. A `RE-IDEATE` verdict in row 5 is a special exit that re-enters the Ideation Loop (Preparation re-runs after Ideation re-completes).
