.gobbi/projects/gobbi/skills/wrap-up/SKILL.md:446:- **MUST be idempotent** — re-run on the same session produces identical project-memory state; collision policy keyed by stable `finding-id` frontmatter.
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/skills/wrap-up/SKILL.md:447:- **MUST never delete** — supersession via `supersedes:` + `superseded_by:` frontmatter pairs; physical deletion is forbidden. When an artifact reaches a terminal state, move it (never delete) to `archive/{type}/` per the move-on-terminal model in [`memorization/templates/archive.md`](../memorization/templates/archive.md).
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/skills/wrap-up/SKILL.md:449:- **MUST request user-confirm** for rules promotion, project-wide design promotion, mistake scope (feature vs project), and unrouted staging files — return `NEEDS_CONTEXT` with a `user-question:` block; the manager runs AskUserQuestion on your behalf.
