    10	
    11	### WHAT — the concrete deliverables
    12	
    13	Three first-class artifacts and one set of consequential edits:
    14	
    15	1. A canonical `orchestration/chat-mode.md` — sub-document of the `orchestration` skill, owning the **full** Chat-Mode specification: posture, the per-user-typed-task workflow shape, per-loop discipline, the per-task `task-record.md` artifact contract, and the explicit-end-of-session Wrap-up trigger.
