.gobbi/projects/gobbi/skills/orchestration/SKILL.md:272:| `⊘ Skipped` | Step bypassed without running `EVALUATION` — either the whole step was skipped (e.g., the user supplied a pre-built artifact for a later step) or `evaluate.mode == 'skip'` for this step (loop ran `WORK` → `MEMORIZATION`, no verdict). The `Verdict` column stays `—`. |
