+- finding-id: codex-risk-3af0c72e
+- Type: scenario_gap
+- Domain: cost
+- Disposition: open
+- Confidence: 75
+- Severity: High
+- Evidence: `draft-iter1.md:65-67`, `:143`, and `:168` combine unbounded task count, always-on evaluation, and no auto-wrap after N tasks.
